# Bulky regenerable data stays out of git (the scripts + seeds + meta.json
# regenerate all of it deterministically; see the READMEs).
*.sim
*.digi
*.root
*.log
run_output/
reco_output/
Data_generation_exploration/Data/truth_mb100/
Data_generation_exploration/Data/training_v1/*.npz
Data_generation_exploration/First_Pass/First_reco/variants/
Data_generation_exploration/First_Pass/results*/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
NewCatalog.xml
test_catalog*.xml
GeneratorLog.xml
Data_generation_exploration/Official_xdigi/truth_official/
Data_generation_exploration/Official_xdigi/training_v2/*.npz
Data_generation_exploration/Official_xdigi/dump.log

# Discrete-time experiments: model weights, prepared datasets and farm logs.
# All regenerable from the scripts, seeds and metadata here (see
# multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/_shared/README.md).
#
# `**` rather than `*`: the experiments were grouped into block folders on
# 2026-09-08, so they now sit at multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/<Block>/<Experiment>/
# rather than one level down. A single `*` stopped matching and would have
# committed 1.23 GB of weights, datasets and farm logs.
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/*.pt
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/*.npz
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/condor/logs/
# Block D (2026-09-14): chains write one folder per (N, q) under results/, so
# the weights and prepared datasets sit one level deeper than before; the smoke
# and timing runs are scratch.
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/**/*.pt
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/**/*.npz
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/Block_D_fixed_step_crossing/*/results/smoke/
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/Block_D_fixed_step_crossing/*/results/smoke_twin/
multi_network_chain_discrete_approach/Block_D_fixed_step_crossing/D1_Chain_grid/results/timing/
# Block E and later (2026-09-16): the single-network chain approach keeps the same
# rule — weights, prepared datasets and farm logs are regenerable, never committed.
single_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/**/*.pt
single_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/**/*.npz
single_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/condor/logs/
single_network_chain_discrete_approach/**/results/smoke/
